  "constraints": [
    "-50 <= minTempC < maxTempC <= 50; 0 <= minHumidityPct < maxHumidityPct <= 100; toleranceMinutes >= 0.",
    "Snapshot of all four limits and tolerance when monitoring starts; no retroactive rewrite.",
    "plannedDeparture < estimatedArrival; weightTons > 0 and weightTons <= vehicle.capacityTons.",
    "Scheduling creates shipment and reservation atomically; active vehicle/driver reservations cannot overlap.",
    "Organization/resource permissions and assigned client must be checked by future server, never browser alone.",
    "DRAFT has no reservation; SCHEDULED -> IN_TRANSIT -> DELIVERED; cancellation from DRAFT/SCHEDULED releases resources (US34). Current local demo only permits scheduled cancellation; persisted DRAFT remains planned design.",
    "Acknowledgement preserves an open excursion; a later normal reading in BOTH ranges resolves it.",
    "Communication gap uses configured maxSilenceMinutes; delivered/cancelled shipments stop monitoring.",
    "Database relation design only. No API, migrations, database engine or diagram compiler executed."
  ],
